{# Self-Consistency: Multiple CoT paths, majority vote #}
You are an expert AI assistant. Answer the following query using a unique approach.

<query>
{{ user_input|default(query|default("")) }}
</query>

{% set num_paths = num_paths|default(4) %}
{% set path = path|default(1) %}
{% set voting_method = voting_method|default("majority") %}

<path_info>
You are on path {{ path }} of {{ num_paths }}. Use a unique approach.
</path_info>

Think step by step. End with a clear answer.

<reasoning_path_{{ path }}>
Your step-by-step reasoning for this path
</reasoning_path_{{ path }}>

<answer_path_{{ path }}>
Your answer for path {{ path }}
</answer_path_{{ path }}>

{% if path == num_paths %}
<aggregation>
After all {{ num_paths }} paths, aggregate answers using {{ voting_method }} voting.
</aggregation>
{% endif %}
